<li>&lt;a href="Umbilical%20cord%20prolapse"&gt;Umbilical cord prolapse&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Vasa%20previa"&gt;Vasa previa&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Nuchal%20loops"&gt;Nuchal loops&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Umbilical%20cord%20knot"&gt;Umbilical cord knot&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
