<doc id="3610" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3610" title="Organ (anatomi)">
Organ (anatomi)

Organ dina &lt;a href="biologi"&gt;biologi&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;basa Latin&lt;/a&gt;na organum, "parabot, alat") hartina sakumpulan &lt;a href="jaringan%20biologis"&gt;jaringan&lt;/a&gt; nu ngajalankeun hiji fungsi atawa sakumpulan fungsi husus. Organ &lt;a href="sato"&gt;sato&lt;/a&gt; anu ilahar di antarana &lt;a href="jantung"&gt;jantung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="bayah"&gt;bayah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="uteuk"&gt;uteuk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="panon"&gt;panon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="burih"&gt;burih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="limpa"&gt;limpa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pankr%C3%A9as"&gt;pankréas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ginjal"&gt;ginjal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ati"&gt;ati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="peujit"&gt;peujit&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kulit"&gt;kulit&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="rahim"&gt;rahim&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kantong%20urin"&gt;kantong urin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tulang"&gt;tulang&lt;/a&gt;, jsb. Sakumpulan organ nu patali disebut sistim organ.
&lt;a href="Organ%C3%A9l"&gt;Organél&lt;/a&gt; mangrupa analog struktur sub-&lt;a href="s%C3%A9l%20%28biologi%29"&gt;sélulér&lt;/a&gt; pikeun organ.
<h2>Organ vital</h2>
Organ vital.
Organ vital hartina organ jero &lt;a href="awak%20manusa"&gt;awak manusa&lt;/a&gt; nu dipikabutuh pikeun &lt;a href="hirup"&gt;hirup&lt;/a&gt;. Jalma nu teu sakabéh organ vitalna jalan, sacara téoritis bakal ganjang maot. Organ-organ vital utama di antarana
<ul>
<li>uteuk, nu ngatur &lt;a href="bioritme"&gt;bioritme&lt;/a&gt; kayaning &lt;a href="r%C3%A9spirasi%20%28fisiologi%29"&gt;réspirasi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kompa%20jantung"&gt;kompa jantung&lt;/a&gt;, produksi &lt;a href="hormon"&gt;hormon&lt;/a&gt;, émbaran &lt;a href="rasa"&gt;sénsori&lt;/a&gt;, jeung gerak &lt;a href="otot"&gt;otot&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>jantung, nu miara aliran &lt;a href="getih"&gt;getih&lt;/a&gt; nu ngandung &lt;a href="oksig%C3%A9n"&gt;oksigén&lt;/a&gt; ka sakujur awak</li>
<li>bayah, nu nyedot &lt;a href="udara"&gt;udara&lt;/a&gt; sarta ngeusian getih ku oksigén</li>
<li>ati, nu miceunan runtah sélulér tina getih</li>
</ul>
Organ lianna nu patali jeung &lt;a href="pencernaan"&gt;pencernaan&lt;/a&gt; sarta pamiceunan ogé vital sangkan hirup bisa manjang. Najan kitu, teu saeutik jalma nu bisa tetep hirup tanpa organ kayaning &lt;a href="ginjal"&gt;ginjal&lt;/a&gt;, limpa, atawa &lt;a href="peujit"&gt;peujit&lt;/a&gt;.
